  "steps": [
    "Marinate the chicken with the turmeric, Kashmiri chilli powder, lemon juice and salt. Refrigerate for 30 minutes.",
    "Shallow fry the chicken in a heavy pan over medium heat until golden on both sides and nearly cooked through. Set aside.",
    "In the same pan, heat the coconut oil over medium heat. Cook the onions with a pinch of salt until golden brown. Add the ginger and garlic for a few seconds until fragrant.",
    "Add the coriander powder, chilli powder, garam masala and fennel powder and sauté for a few seconds.",
    "Add the tomatoes, curry leaves and salt. When the tomatoes soften, add a spoonful or two of water to make a paste.",
    "Return the chicken and stir until coated. Stir-fry in the masala for 4–5 minutes, then adjust the salt and spices.",
    "Serve with parotta or rice."
  ],
